                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ovis ammon, the largest wild sheep, which roams the highlands of Central Asia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "60f87fb2-2067-4d1f-a0dd-6d9472228f2d",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "mountain sheep",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mountain sheep",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28721b9e-0d88-362b-a2b1-15d705474eee",
                                        "entry_id": "e8432af9-7f42-3b01-97b4-0fce2413c19c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The argali."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2d9b57c-9972-3dbe-9093-aa6cb23a9a6e",
                                        "entry_id": "e8432af9-7f42-3b01-97b4-0fce2413c19c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The bighorn (Ovis canadensis) of the Rocky Mountains."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56bdf737-7fb0-4e40-8357-b62cc5179479",
                                                "sense_id": "f2d9b57c-9972-3dbe-9093-aa6cb23a9a6e",
                                                "text": "On the 29th we passed into the territory of the Panock Indians—a tribe of hunters, who find an abundant subsistence in the myriads of mountain sheep, antelopes, prairie dogs, and other animals, with which the country abounds."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d8aa34c-b699-4ff1-a287-83bd40549265",
                                                "sense_id": "f2d9b57c-9972-3dbe-9093-aa6cb23a9a6e",
                                                "text": "Wild mountain sheep are perhaps the most accomplished and dare-devil acrobats in the animal world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a13a92b4-487c-4194-a40b-ba639d9aa7c3",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "argalí",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eaeaa1ee-6989-4f2a-90d5-0544c6e19e5f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "盘羊",
                        "target_lang_code": "zh",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19a3f1ef-7035-43a0-bcaf-97c0ee6ca803",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "Argali",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Argali",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "681559e4-2c7a-32b0-b110-66079d89efc7",
                                        "entry_id": "796080f2-5975-306e-86a7-ee6c159b4f46",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in den Hochgebirgen von Ost- und Zentralasien lebendes Wildschaf"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b529511-8117-47e0-b864-aaa995c3cb98",
                                                "sense_id": "681559e4-2c7a-32b0-b110-66079d89efc7",
                                                "text": "„Als Stammform des europäischen Hausschafes gilt der Mufflon, als Stammform des Merinoschafes und der asiatischen und afrikanischen Hausschafe das Argali.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0136a504-ceda-4d48-8d94-d46e09324952",
                                                "sense_id": "681559e4-2c7a-32b0-b110-66079d89efc7",
                                                "text": "„Wie es sich ergab, beschlossen ein paar Freunde von mir und ich eines Jahres, die Weihnachtswoche mit der Jagd auf Argalis zu verbringen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8fa55e85-1424-4c11-a638-c3b1f65614dd",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "Riesenwildschaf",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "696c01ec-512c-47a5-b782-d4620ac4cb5f",
                        "source_entry_id": "1870f9db-a3b5-3525-b5c6-2376d4e81aca",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1464dcb-6f71-3f19-ae11-789882eae811",
                        "target_lang_word": "argali",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "argali",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cdde2c8-36c4-3fd4-93fd-0bef0ea936ae",
                                        "entry_id": "db017c6d-e0e4-38ed-ab62-fff9919e1436",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grand mouflon d’Asie, vivant en Asie centrale, en Chine et en Mongolie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5e87df8-7fee-449a-821c-0514ad13ddf3",
                                                "sense_id": "1cdde2c8-36c4-3fd4-93fd-0bef0ea936ae",
                                                "text": "L’argali, la zibeline, la taupe dorée de Sibérie, le musc delà Chine, ne se trouvent point à la baie de Hudson ni dans aucune autre partie du nord-ouest du nouveau continent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b833bed0-5f95-4f68-8d7a-b3e6b9de3c20",
                                                "sense_id": "1cdde2c8-36c4-3fd4-93fd-0bef0ea936ae",
                                                "text": "Désirant préparer taxidermiquement un des argalis, nous avions emmené avec nous des pâtres qui se chargèrent de transporter ce bel échantillon de la faune du Khorassan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
